speechtext:
My friend is in an awful position, and he is trying to get out of it in a way which I may say I would not try myself. I remember some time ago in this House, when information was asked of me, I leaned over and asked the assistant deputy minister for the information. The information was given to me in good faith, I believe; but it was a mistake. I gave it as I received it from the assistant deputy Postmaster General, What did I find ? The hon. member for Rouville standing up and saying: What a shame;
Mr. LEMIEUX.	I
there is the minister trying to hide himself behind the officers of his department. Now it is all the other way.
